{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>58歲鄧兆尊早前在網上節目大爆娛樂圈存在一位年齡逾五十歲並食盡一至四線男星的「頂級集郵女星」，震撼爆料隨即引發 …</p><p></p>\n<p>58歲鄧兆尊早前在網上節目大爆娛樂圈存在一位年齡逾五十歲並食盡一至四線男星的「頂級集郵女星」，震撼爆料隨即引發全城網民根據線索瘋狂點名。面對多位一線花旦無辜捲入桃色風波，他不但親口為名單上各個嫌疑人逐一洗白，更在回應期間加碼吐出比集郵更令人咋舌的豪門暗黑操作。\n</p>\n<h2>鄧兆尊大爆年逾五十歲集郵女星名單</h2>\n<p>鄧兆尊早前在節目《男人萬歲》中拋出震撼彈，公開直指圈內有一名年逾五十歲兼外形出眾的「頂級集郵女星」戰績彪炳。他透露該名女星獵男無數，基本上由一線至四線男星都全部集齊，兩人曾經有過合作卻從未傳出緋聞。廣大網民隨即化身網絡神探，翻查他出道以來的劇集合作名單，將符合「有樣有身材」及年齡條件的女藝人逐一列出。輿論迅速發酵下，佘詩曼、伍詠薇、陳煒甚至關之琳等知名女星皆無辜躺槍，成為網民瘋狂猜測及討論熱議對象。</p>\n<h2>陳煒率先割席 鄧兆尊急為佘詩曼洗白</h2>\n<p>成為嫌疑人之一並被捲入風波的陳煒昨日率先公開回應，直指自己完全不認識男方，僅在某些活動見過幾次，對事件毫無興趣並表明「冇任何Comment」。面對風波越演越烈，鄧兆尊今日（23日）亦急忙透過節目《3寶Channel》為多位女星澄清。他明確否認網上流傳名單，強調自己與陳煒完全不認識，亦從未與伍詠薇合作。提到佘詩曼時，他更直接表示「阿佘係男仔，係兄弟，佢自己私底下同邊個拍拖我唔理，我唔清楚，我唔會過問」，力證各人與集郵事件毫無關連。\n</p>\n<h2>華姐冠軍葉璇曾半夜入房傾偈問賽果</h2>\n<p>除了本地多位一線花旦被波及，更有網民將矛頭指向曾參演劇集《尋秦記》的葉璇。鄧兆尊隨即將當年擔任華裔小姐表演嘉賓時遇過的各種匪夷所思狀況全盤托出，坦言當年赴外地拍外景時情況極度混亂。他回憶當時每一位參選佳麗都會輪流進入其房間傾偈幾分鐘，而葉璇亦曾經入過他房間，主要是詢問自己有沒有機會贏得冠軍。他當時直接向對方坦白「你唔使問啦，你應該係冠軍啦」，雖然大爆當年選美內幕，但他亦再三澄清葉璇與集郵王身份無關。</p>\n<h2>網民點名江欣燕牽出圈內富豪暗黑潛規則</h2>\n<p>大批網民依然對集郵女星真身充滿好奇，有人更根據線索直指「江欣燕同佢本身都好熟，而且仲要有樣有身材，兼且依家未夠60」，誓要尋根究底。對此鄧兆尊表明不會再進一步透露姓名以免穿幫，更笑言大家若想知真相大可參考吳君如以往言論。他隨後更索性將話題轉向圈中更震撼的潛規則，自爆曾親眼目睹名人富豪「送老婆畀朋友招呼」，直指娛樂圈內發生關係不外乎貪圖美貌或利益交換。當一方能夠提供利益幫助時，雙方就會按照遊戲規則進行短暫相聚，完事後自然會好聚好散。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274013236483080_17217966046adb0b2499125.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"7jSDE7CyrfZRwk3Wl_zIU_vvizx-4IIYygpEesoKRHo.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179274013236483080_17217966046adb0b2499125.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179255029974618512_11425048476ad8259bea5ba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"鄧兆尊 男人萬歲 （圖片來源：《男人萬歲》截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179255029974618512_11425048476ad8259bea5ba.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《男人萬歲》截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176639965539514296_204181761569491ea7b457a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"葉璇 爭產 前華裔小姐冠軍葉璇（圖片來源：新傳媒圖片庫）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176639965539514296_204181761569491ea7b457a.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>前華裔小姐冠軍葉璇（圖片來源：新傳媒圖片庫）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177736965273792365_133054621469f082351336d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"葉璇 爭產 （圖片來源：小紅書）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/177736965273792365_133054621469f082351336d.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>葉璇曾半夜入房傾偈問賽果（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/-_947221228691040b58a01f-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳煒 吳若希 （圖片來源：IG@alicechanwai）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/-_947221228691040b58a01f-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>陳煒率先割席（圖片來源：IG@alicechanwai）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/177882565820048942_16142416996a06b9ba86a45.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"佘詩曼 黃子華 （圖片來源：IG@charmaine_sheh）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/177882565820048942_16142416996a06b9ba86a45.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>鄧兆尊急為佘詩曼洗白（圖片來源：IG@charmaine_sheh）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%98%e8%a9%a9%e6%9b%bc/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">佘詩曼</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%94%b7%e4%ba%ba%e8%90%ac%e6%ad%b2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">男人萬歲</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%84%a7%e5%85%86%e5%b0%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄧兆尊</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3528880\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 23 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:03:57.139205+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1544,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:22:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T08:58:30.312563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:58:30.312563+00:00","content_hash":"6904db4f6c19d361910a48e1bd279df49edd4a9ad14de925428e3293a5df5007","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}